# Salesforce Developer Bridge Program – Day 3
## Validation Rules, Flows & Triggers

## Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation of Salesforce declarative automation using **Validation Rules** and **Record-Triggered Flows** for a Placement Management System.

The objective was to understand when to use Validation Rules, Flows, or Apex Triggers and implement business requirements using Salesforce best practices.

> **Key Learning:** Prefer declarative automation (Validation Rules and Flows) before using Apex whenever possible. :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}

