# Concepts Learned

## Validation Rule
- Prevents invalid records from being saved.
- Displays an error message when business rules are violated.
- Used to maintain data quality.

## Flow
- Declarative automation tool.
- Automates record updates, emails, approvals, and related record creation.
- No coding required.

## Apex Trigger
- Executes custom business logic before or after database events.
- Used only when Flow cannot satisfy complex business requirements.

## Record-Triggered Flow
- Automatically runs whenever a record is created or updated.
- Can update records, send emails, and create related records.

