# Flow vs Trigger

| Scenario | Recommended Tool |
|----------|------------------|
| Update Fields | Flow |
| Create Related Record | Flow |
| Send Email | Flow |
| Call External REST API | Apex Trigger |
| Complex Multi-object Logic | Apex Trigger |
| Large Data Processing | Apex Trigger |

